  heatKernelReducedDistance n τ x = ‖x‖ ^ 2 / (4 * τ)
Poincare.D11.ReducedVolume.heatKernel_asymptotics {n : ℕ} {τ : ℝ} (hτ : 0 < τ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
  (4 * Real.pi * τ) ^ (-↑n / 2) * Real.exp (-heatKernelReducedDistance n τ x) =
